(1) using the model tokenizer's NFKC+casefold as the ground-truth definition of "duplicate," and
(2) measuring production-tool residual FN against that GT on REAL C4-multilingual at 95.1%, driven by
CJK fullwidth prevalence. That is an empirical-magnitude contribution on a known mechanism — a
re-framing + measurement, not a new mechanism. Workshop-finding altitude, not a mechanism paper.

